sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant A as App or portal
  participant AU as Firebase Auth
  participant API as al-ai or al-core
  participant FS as Firestore
  U->>A: email and password, or Google
  A->>AU: sign in
  AU-->>A: ID token (user id and role claim, valid 1 hour)
  Note over A,AU: The SDK refreshes the token before it expires
  A->>FS: read with the token
  FS-->>A: allowed or denied by the rules (role and ownership)
  A->>API: request with Authorization: Bearer token
  API->>AU: verify signature and expiry (Admin SDK)
  API->>API: check role and ownership, validate the body
  API->>FS: write with the service account key
  API-->>A: response or error body
